  "estbl": {
   "description": "The estbl saturation vapor pressure table of wv_sat_init (wv_saturation.F90:191-254): 251 knots at T = tmin + (i - 1) K, i = 1..251, tmin = 127.16 K, holding svp_trans(T) (wv_sat_methods.F90:479-513, the Goff-Gratch mixed-phase blend over the 20 K band below tmelt) in double precision; estblf clamps T to tmax = 375.16 K so the 251st knot is unreachable. The values are copied verbatim from the committed function_tables.estbl of cam_wv_saturation.esm (same data as the Fortran's estbl; the CLI cannot import a function table by reference - function tables are data, not template libraries - so the table is duplicated here and cross-checked against the cam_qsat.csv dump rows by the evap tests).",
